四、 We would love to use Chi-square test to determine if there is a statistical difference in the amount of illness between those who ate tomatoes and those who did not on a cruise ship.

|                | Disease | No Disease | Total |
|----------------|---------|------------|-------|
| Tomatoes       | 40      | 40         | 80    |
| No Tomatoes    | 80      | 60         | 140   |
| Total          | 120     | 100        | 220   |

1. What are the degrees of freedom?  
<br><br>

2. Please fill in the following table with the expected frequencies (keep two decimals):

|                | Disease | No Disease |
|----------------|---------|------------|
| Tomatoes       |         |            |
| No Tomatoes    |         |            |
<br><br>

3. Please perform the Chi-square test and draw a conclusion (alpha = 0.05).
<br><br>

